---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="What knaif.org collects about visitors: no cookies, no analytics, no trackers."
>
  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>
      knaif.org is run by Blackdeep Technologies Ltd. It sets no cookies and uses no analytics
      or trackers.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Like any website, it is served by a hosting provider that keeps standard access logs:
        IP address, browser, page requested and time.
      </li>
      <li>
        If you choose a light or dark theme, your browser remembers it locally. It is never
        sent to us.
      </li>
      <li>
        Downloads and links to GitHub and Hugging Face take you to their sites, where their
        own privacy policies apply.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Questions: <a href="https://github.com/blackdeep-tech/knaif/issues">open an issue on
      GitHub</a>.
    </p>
    <p><small>Last updated 2026-10-03.</small></p>
  </section>
</Base>
